%U A401207 22917228200448768809976917203919876653056000,1610579958140265894117964478948666840650851626778624000,362979236342030118140149279521755693292412907479078145517158400000
%N A401207 Central-cross product divided by the central-cross sum in the (2*n + 1) X (2*n + 1) square array formed by the integers 1, 2, ..., (2*n + 1)^2 in order.
%C A401207 For n = 1, the corresponding ratio is 1920/25 = 384/5, which is not an integer. For each n >= 2, the ratio is an integer divisible by n. Indeed, letting c = 2*n^2 + 2*n + 1, the central-cross sum equals c*(4*n + 1), while the central-cross product contains both c and c + (n - 1)*(2*n + 1) = n*(4*n + 1) as distinct factors.
%H A401207 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calculator">Calculator (Key layout)</a>.
%F A401207 a(n) = (Product_{k = 1..n} (c^2 - k^2)*(c^2 - k^2*(2*n + 1)^2))/(4*n + 1), where c = 2*n^2 + 2*n + 1.
%F A401207 a(n) = A399589(n)/A393855(n).
%e A401207 For n = 2, the array is:
%e A401207   21 22 23 24 25
%e A401207   16 17 18 19 20
%e A401207   11 12 13 14 15
%e A401207    6  7  8  9 10
%e A401207    1  2  3  4  5
%e A401207 The central-cross product is 3*8*11*12*13*14*15*18*23 = 3580536960, while the central-cross sum is 3 + 8 + 11 + 12 + 13 + 14 + 15 + 18 + 23 = 117. Hence, a(2) = 3580536960/117 = 30602880.
%Y A401207 Cf. A393855, A395722, A399589, A399778.
